  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Creation; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> hands; <strong>Price</strong> 75,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThese leather workman gloves perpetually look dirty, no matter how well they are cleaned. While worn, these gloves provide the wearer with the ability to forge metal with a touch, as the Forge Creation talent. The target also gains a +10 competence bonus to all Craft checks made involving metal objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Craft Apparatus, Creation sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 37,500 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
